  <h2 class="mt-8">1. Scope</h2>
  <p>This policy explains how DataQube Analytics handles personal data belonging to individuals located in the European Union and European Economic Area, in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>

  <h2 class="mt-8">2. Legal basis for processing</h2>
  <p>We process personal data based on legitimate interest (responding to inquiries), consent (where you submit a form), or contractual necessity (where we deliver services under an agreement).</p>

  <h2 class="mt-8">3. Your rights under GDPR</h2>
  <p>If GDPR applies to you, you have the right to access, correct, delete, restrict processing of, or receive a copy of your personal data, and the right to object to certain processing. Contact us at {{ site.nap.email }} to exercise these rights.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-8">4. Data transfers</h2>
  <p>Personal data may be processed in Canada or other countries where our service providers operate. We take reasonable steps to ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for any such transfers.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-8">5. Data protection contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about how we handle personal data under GDPR can be sent to {{ site.nap.email }}.</p>
